5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,We must verify if the development budget covers recurring operational costs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I am curious about the readmission figures from the previous call-back trial.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about how new programs impact existing nursing rosters and staff burnout.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I need to know if our booking system can handle extra daily traffic.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I am concerned about long-term stability and whether partners truly commit to us.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If we ignore running costs, the project fails within a year.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, data beats speculation. I want to see what actually worked before.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, I agree, but we must also check who is left to do the work.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, exactly. If the screens crash, the whole day seizes up.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I have seen many good ideas crumble because the paperwork was weak.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look at the ledger to see what is truly available.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will check the readmission data and the therapy staffing review.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
