18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will check the booking system records and room coverage.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will review the board minutes and the data agreements with outside surgeries.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Let us proceed with these checks to ground our decision in fact.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,I will wait for the numbers to speak for themselves.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I hope we find a balance that protects our team.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I just want to make sure the doors don't jam.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will look for the cracks before they become chasms.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
