35,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ledger shows our development allocation is down by nearly a quarter.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,The readmission data proves the call-back trial actually saved lives.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The staffing review shows therapy is bleeding staff, but midwifery has slack.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The booking system only holds named slots; anything else vanishes from reports.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The board minutes show a joint clinic collapsed because no one owned the rota.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, saving lives is good, but if it costs us money we do not have, it is a liability.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, a program that works is worth more than a budget that looks pretty.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, I worry that adding therapy work will push the remaining staff over the edge.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, if the work is not in the system, it is not real to the managers.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, I agree. I also found that outside data agreements take fourteen months to sign.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I found that off-site contacts draw no tariff from the regional fund.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,The midwifery slack is a rare window. We should use it before it closes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,I agree. A midwifery program fits the current roster without breaking the team.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"But if it is not a named slot, the booking screens will not show it.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, that is a technical fix. The real risk is relying on an outside body that never signed up.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,So we need a program that stays on site and uses existing staff.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,The midwifery option fits that. The data supports it.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,It also protects the therapy team from further strain. I am comfortable with that.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I can live with it if we create a specific named slot for it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am relieved. A clear, internal structure is the only way to keep it alive.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
